A design [[commons|The Commons]] would be a [[well managed|Ostrom’s 8 rules]] set of resources. A complex combination of culture, economy, [[systems|Systems]]. This is not design [[wealth|Wealth]] free for the taking?

See [[A New Design Commons]], [[Elinor Ostrom]], [[David Bollier]], [[An authentic commons is not a temporary affair]], [[Creative Commons]], [[Public Domain]], [[Waste = Food]]
